{"name":"-57-2-2","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2023SAGA_Park_b","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"Campaion-34","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The morning has put you in a lively and cheerful mood, but right now, you are feeling deeply troubled. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You've been impatient to meet your Dolls ever since you saw Late Night Café's poster. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You've even let this anxiety seep into the afternoon and your time with Franchouchou. Some of the more astute members have probably noticed your strange mood, but no one blames you. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Even though you have an agreement with them."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sigh... Never thought I'd be put in such a dilemma..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Button_Click","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You walk into a public phone booth and dial the number on the name card that the ninja gave you the previous night."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hello? Is this... the ninja?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ninja speaking. How can I help?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I would like you to help me look up Late Night Café."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"For what reason?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"p