'S NOT A DREAM!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"m_wv_title","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My world is ravaged by war and chaos. I lead a group of girls full of dreams to fight, not for wealth or power, but only for a quiet and peaceful life..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's exactly right!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But when I woke up one day, I found myself in tranquil Saga. Now you must lead a group of talented girls full of dreams to conquer the world with beautiful song and dance..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Uh... That sounds a bit weird, but that's pretty much the gist of it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ninja","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We've all had such dreams before. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But now that our eyes are wide open, we must learn to accept reality as it is."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ninja","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-420","spriteScale":"1.6"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":